export const bodies: Record<string, string> = {
  "kettle-photos.en-US": "Every product photo in the shop is taken in our workshop, with no studio and no assistant. Many people ask how the kettle shot was made, so here it is.\n\n## The kit\n\nOur kit is plain:\n\n- A full-frame camera we have used for six years, with a 90 mm macro lens\n- One 300 W continuous light in a 60 cm octagonal softbox\n- Two foam white cards and one black card\n- A roll of white PVC backdrop from the hardware store\n\n| Kit | Cost | Can you skip it |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Camera and lens | About $1,300 used | A new phone does well too |\n| Continuous light | About $170 | Soft light by a window will do |\n| White and black cards | About $6 | No, the best money we spent |\n\n## The light\n\nA steel kettle is a mirror that shows everything around it. So the point of the light is not to light it, but to choose what it reflects.\n\n1. The softbox goes behind the kettle on the left, a little higher than it, for one long highlight.\n2. A white card on the right sends light back, so the shadows do not go black.\n3. A small black card under the spout gives its edge a dark outline, which makes it look crisp.\n\n> When you shoot something shiny, decide first what it will reflect, then where the light comes from.\n\n## The shot\n\nThe aperture goes to f/8 to f/11, so everything from spout to handle is sharp. Shutter speed does not matter: the camera is on a tripod and a continuous light does not flash. We take a series at different focus points and merge them afterwards, which is called focus stacking.\n\n## The edit\n\nThe edit does three things: it removes dust, sets the white balance and makes the backdrop pure white. It does not change the kettle's shape or add a sheen that is not there. What customers get should look like the picture.\n\nAt the end every image is exported as AVIF at 160, 480 and 1200 pixels wide, and the web shop picks the one that fits the screen.\n\nNext time: how to photograph textiles, which is another thing altogether.\n",
  "kettle-photos.zh-CN": "店里每一张商品图都是在工作室里拍的，没有棚，也没有助理。很多人好奇手冲壶那张图是怎么拍的，今天说说。\n\n## 器材\n\n我们的器材很朴素：\n\n- 一台用了六年的全画幅相机，配 90 毫米微距镜头\n- 一盏 300 瓦的常亮灯，加一个 60 厘米的八角柔光箱\n- 两块泡沫白板，一块黑板\n- 一张从五金店买来的白色 PVC 背景纸\n\n| 器材 | 价格 | 能不能省 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 相机和镜头 | 二手约 9000 元 | 新手机也能拍得很好 |\n| 常亮灯 | 约 1200 元 | 窗边的散射光可以代替 |\n| 白板和黑板 | 约 40 元 | 不能省，最值的一笔 |\n\n## 布光\n\n不锈钢壶身像一面镜子，会映出周围的一切。所以布光的重点不是“照亮”，而是“控制它反射什么”。\n\n1. 柔光箱放在壶的左后方，高出壶身一点，形成一条长长的高光。\n2. 右侧立一块白板，把光反回来，让暗部不至于死黑。\n3. 壶嘴下方放一小块黑板，让壶嘴的边缘有一条深色的轮廓线，看起来更挺。\n\n> 拍反光的东西，先想清楚它会映出什么，再去想光从哪里来。\n\n## 拍摄\n\n光圈开到 f/8 到 f/11，保证从壶嘴到壶把都清楚。快门不重要，因为相机在三脚架上，常亮灯也不会闪。我们会拍一组不同对焦点的照片，后期合成，这叫堆栈。\n\n## 后期\n\n后期只做三件事：去掉灰尘，校正白平衡，把背景调成纯白。不改壶的形状，也不加不存在的光泽。客人收到的东西，应该和图上一样。\n\n最后，所有图片都导出成 AVIF，各存 160、480 和 1200 像素宽的一份，网店按屏幕大小挑一份来用。\n\n下次我们聊聊怎么拍织物，那又是完全不同的一件事。\n",
  "stock-sync-api.en-US": "Our shop floor is in Hangzhou, but the web shop kept its stock in a table of its own. When the shop sold the last kettle on a Saturday, the web shop still said \"in stock\", and on Monday we called customers to apologise. This year we put both on one stock count, through the open API of the shop admin. Here is how, for other owners with a shop floor.\n\n> The API is still in public beta and fields may change. The examples below use version `2026-10`.\n\n## Before you start: get a token\n\nUnder \"Settings → Open API\" in the admin, create an app with the `products:read` and `inventory:write` scopes. Saving it shows a token that starts with `shk_`. **It is shown once**, so put it in your password manager right away.\n\nSend it in a header with every request:\n\n```bash\ncurl https://api.shanhai.example/v1/products?limit=2 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer shk_live_8f2c1e\" \\\n  -H \"Accept: application/json\"\n```\n\nThe answer is a page of products:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"pour-over-kettle\",\n      \"title\": \"Morning Pour-Over Kettle\",\n      \"variants\": [\n        { \"sku\": \"PK-MIST\", \"color\": \"mist\", \"stock\": 23 },\n        { \"sku\": \"PK-CHAR\", \"color\": \"charcoal\", \"stock\": 0 }\n      ],\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T09:12:44Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"next\": \"eyJvZmZzZXQiOjJ9\"\n}\n```\n\nWhen `next` is not empty, pass it as the `cursor` parameter to get the next page. Do not build offsets yourself: a cursor holds steady while products come and go.\n\n## Step one: pull everything once\n\nThe till on the shop floor is a small program we wrote in Go. When it starts, it pulls every product of the web shop and maps each SKU to a local barcode:\n\n```go\ntype Variant struct {\n\tSKU   string `json:\"sku\"`\n\tColor string `json:\"color\"`\n\tStock int    `json:\"stock\"`\n}\n\ntype page struct {\n\tData []struct {\n\t\tID       string    `json:\"id\"`\n\t\tVariants []Variant `json:\"variants\"`\n\t} `json:\"data\"`\n\tNext string `json:\"next\"`\n}\n\nfunc pullAll(ctx context.Context, token string) (map[string]Variant, error) {\n\tout := map[string]Variant{}\n\tcursor := \"\"\n\tfor {\n\t\treq, _ := http.NewRequestWithContext(ctx, \"GET\", base+\"/v1/products?limit=100&cursor=\"+cursor, nil)\n\t\treq.Header.Set(\"Authorization\", \"Bearer \"+token)\n\t\tres, err := http.DefaultClient.Do(req)\n\t\tif err != nil {\n\t\t\treturn nil, err\n\t\t}\n\t\tvar p page\n\t\terr = json.NewDecoder(res.Body).Decode(&p)\n\t\tres.Body.Close()\n\t\tif err != nil {\n\t\t\treturn nil, err\n\t\t}\n\t\tfor _, prod := range p.Data {\n\t\t\tfor _, v := range prod.Variants {\n\t\t\t\tout[v.SKU] = v\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tif p.Next == \"\" {\n\t\t\treturn out, nil\n\t\t}\n\t\tcursor = p.Next\n\t}\n}\n```\n\nA full pull once a night is enough. The webhook below covers the rest of the day.\n\n## Step two: sell one, take one off\n\nFor each piece sold on the shop floor, the till calls the adjust endpoint. It sends the **change**, not the count left, so two sales at the same time do not overwrite each other:\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST https://api.shanhai.example/v1/inventory/adjust \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer shk_live_8f2c1e\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"Idempotency-Key: pos-2026-10-08-0042\" \\\n  -d '{\"sku\": \"PK-MIST\", \"delta\": -1, \"reason\": \"store_sale\"}'\n```\n\n`Idempotency-Key` matters. The shop's network is flaky and the till retries after a timeout, and one key takes effect only once in 24 hours.\n\n| Field | Type | Meaning |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `sku` | string | The SKU of the variant |\n| `delta` | integer | Positive to add stock, negative to take it off |\n| `reason` | string | `store_sale`, `return`, `restock` or `correction` |\n| `note` | string | Optional, up to 200 characters |\n\n## Step three: catch the web shop's changes with a webhook\n\nThe other way round, the shop floor must know when the web shop sells. Enter an address in the app settings and subscribe to `inventory.updated`. For every change the admin sends a POST:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"inventory.updated\",\n  \"sku\": \"PK-MIST\",\n  \"stock\": 21,\n  \"delta\": -2,\n  \"source\": \"web_order\",\n  \"occurredAt\": \"2026-10-08T10:03:12Z\"\n}\n```\n\nAlways check the signature, or anyone can write stock into your till. It is an HMAC-SHA256 of the body, in the `X-Shanhai-Signature` header:\n\n```ts\nimport { createHmac, timingSafeEqual } from 'node:crypto'\n\nexport function verify(body: string, header: string, secret: string): boolean {\n  const expected = createHmac('sha256', secret).update(body).digest('hex')\n  const given = header.replace(/^sha256=/, '')\n  if (given.length !== expected.length) return false\n  return timingSafeEqual(Buffer.from(given), Buffer.from(expected))\n}\n```\n\nOn an event we do one thing: set the local stock to the event's `stock`. Events can arrive out of order, so we compare `occurredAt` first and drop older ones.\n\n## What tripped us up\n\n1. **Time zones.** Every time in the API is UTC. The shop's daily report cuts days at Beijing time, and its first version counted sales after 8 pm on the next day.\n2. **Rate limits.** Each token gets at most 10 requests a second. With `limit` at 100, a few hundred products come down in seconds: do not fetch them one at a time.\n3. **Sets.** A set of coasters is one SKU on the web and two single pieces on the shop floor. In the end we split it on the web too and sell the set as a bundle.\n\n```yaml\n# Configuration of the till\nsync:\n  base: https://api.shanhai.example\n  token_env: SHANHAI_TOKEN\n  full_pull: \"0 3 * * *\"   # every night at 3 am\n  webhook:\n    listen: \":8443\"\n    secret_env: SHANHAI_WEBHOOK_SECRET\n```\n\nThe gap between the two counts went from a dozen pieces a week to none. If you are doing the same, leave a comment or write to us.\n",
  "stock-sync-api.zh-CN": "山海的线下门店在杭州，网店的库存却一直放在另一张表里。周末门店卖掉最后一只手冲壶，网店还挂着“有货”，周一就要给客人打电话道歉。今年我们把两边接到了同一份库存上，用的就是店铺后台的开放接口。这篇写下整个过程，给同样有门店的店主参考。\n\n> 接口目前还在公开测试，字段可能还会调整。下面的例子都基于 `2026-10` 版本。\n\n## 准备：拿到令牌\n\n在后台的“设置 → 开放接口”里新建一个应用，勾选 `products:read`、`inventory:write` 两个权限。保存后会得到一个以 `shk_` 开头的令牌，**只显示一次**，请马上存到密码管理器里。\n\n每个请求都在请求头里带上它：\n\n```bash\ncurl https://api.shanhai.example/v1/products?limit=2 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer shk_live_8f2c1e\" \\\n  -H \"Accept: application/json\"\n```\n\n返回的是分页后的商品列表：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"pour-over-kettle\",\n      \"title\": \"晨间手冲壶\",\n      \"variants\": [\n        { \"sku\": \"PK-MIST\", \"color\": \"mist\", \"stock\": 23 },\n        { \"sku\": \"PK-CHAR\", \"color\": \"charcoal\", \"stock\": 0 }\n      ],\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T09:12:44Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"next\": \"eyJvZmZzZXQiOjJ9\"\n}\n```\n\n`next` 不为空时，把它原样放进 `cursor` 参数就能取下一页。不要自己拼 offset，商品增删时游标比偏移量稳定。\n\n## 第一步：全量拉一次\n\n门店的收银系统是我们自己写的一个小程序，用 Go。启动时先把网店的全部商品拉一遍，建立 SKU 和本地条码的对应关系：\n\n```go\ntype Variant struct {\n\tSKU   string `json:\"sku\"`\n\tColor string `json:\"color\"`\n\tStock int    `json:\"stock\"`\n}\n\ntype page struct {\n\tData []struct {\n\t\tID       string    `json:\"id\"`\n\t\tVariants []Variant `json:\"variants\"`\n\t} `json:\"data\"`\n\tNext string `json:\"next\"`\n}\n\nfunc pullAll(ctx context.Context, token string) (map[string]Variant, error) {\n\tout := map[string]Variant{}\n\tcursor := \"\"\n\tfor {\n\t\treq, _ := http.NewRequestWithContext(ctx, \"GET\", base+\"/v1/products?limit=100&cursor=\"+cursor, nil)\n\t\treq.Header.Set(\"Authorization\", \"Bearer \"+token)\n\t\tres, err := http.DefaultClient.Do(req)\n\t\tif err != nil {\n\t\t\treturn nil, err\n\t\t}\n\t\tvar p page\n\t\terr = json.NewDecoder(res.Body).Decode(&p)\n\t\tres.Body.Close()\n\t\tif err != nil {\n\t\t\treturn nil, err\n\t\t}\n\t\tfor _, prod := range p.Data {\n\t\t\tfor _, v := range prod.Variants {\n\t\t\t\tout[v.SKU] = v\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tif p.Next == \"\" {\n\t\t\treturn out, nil\n\t\t}\n\t\tcursor = p.Next\n\t}\n}\n```\n\n全量拉取每天凌晨跑一次就够了，平时靠下面的 webhook。\n\n## 第二步：卖出一件，就扣一件\n\n门店每卖出一件，收银程序调用一次扣减接口。注意这里传的是**变化量**而不是剩余数量，这样两边同时卖出时不会互相覆盖：\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST https://api.shanhai.example/v1/inventory/adjust \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer shk_live_8f2c1e\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"Idempotency-Key: pos-2026-10-08-0042\" \\\n  -d '{\"sku\": \"PK-MIST\", \"delta\": -1, \"reason\": \"store_sale\"}'\n```\n\n`Idempotency-Key` 很重要。门店的网络不稳定，收银程序超时后会重试，同一个键在 24 小时内只会生效一次。\n\n| 字段 | 类型 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `sku` | string | 变体的 SKU |\n| `delta` | integer | 正数入库，负数出库 |\n| `reason` | string | `store_sale`、`return`、`restock` 或 `correction` |\n| `note` | string | 可选，最多 200 字 |\n\n## 第三步：用 webhook 接住网店的变化\n\n反过来，网店卖出时门店也要知道。在应用设置里填一个地址，订阅 `inventory.updated` 事件。每次库存变动，后台会发一个 POST：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"inventory.updated\",\n  \"sku\": \"PK-MIST\",\n  \"stock\": 21,\n  \"delta\": -2,\n  \"source\": \"web_order\",\n  \"occurredAt\": \"2026-10-08T10:03:12Z\"\n}\n```\n\n一定要校验签名，否则谁都能往你的门店系统里写库存。签名是请求体的 HMAC-SHA256，放在 `X-Shanhai-Signature` 头里：\n\n```ts\nimport { createHmac, timingSafeEqual } from 'node:crypto'\n\nexport function verify(body: string, header: string, secret: string): boolean {\n  const expected = createHmac('sha256', secret).update(body).digest('hex')\n  const given = header.replace(/^sha256=/, '')\n  if (given.length !== expected.length) return false\n  return timingSafeEqual(Buffer.from(given), Buffer.from(expected))\n}\n```\n\n收到事件后，我们只做一件事：把本地库存设成事件里的 `stock`。事件可能乱序到达，所以先比较 `occurredAt`，旧的事件直接丢掉。\n\n## 踩过的坑\n\n1. **时区。** 接口里的时间都是 UTC。门店的日报按北京时间切日，第一版报表把晚上八点以后的销售算到了第二天。\n2. **限流。** 每个令牌每秒最多 10 个请求。全量拉取时 `limit` 开到 100，几百个商品几秒钟就拉完了，不要一个一个查。\n3. **套装商品。** 一套杯垫在网店是一个 SKU，门店却是两个单品。我们最后在网店也拆成了单品，再用“组合”功能卖套装。\n\n```yaml\n# 收银程序的配置\nsync:\n  base: https://api.shanhai.example\n  token_env: SHANHAI_TOKEN\n  full_pull: \"0 3 * * *\"   # 每天凌晨三点\n  webhook:\n    listen: \":8443\"\n    secret_env: SHANHAI_WEBHOOK_SECRET\n```\n\n现在两边的库存差异从每周十几件降到了零。如果你也在做类似的事情，欢迎在评论区留言，或者直接给我们写信。\n",
  "theme-css.en-US": "Owners often ask whether they can give their shop their own brand colours. They can, without touching a template. Every colour, corner and typeface of a shop theme comes from a dozen CSS variables, and you override them under \"Settings → Theme → Custom CSS\".\n\n## The variables a theme reads\n\n| Variable | Default | Used for |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `--background` | `#f2f4f5` | The page |\n| `--foreground` | `#1c2433` | Body text |\n| `--primary` | `#1f3a5f` | Buttons, links and prices |\n| `--muted-foreground` | `#5b6876` | Secondary text |\n| `--border` | `#d3dae0` | Borders of cards and inputs |\n| `--radius` | `0.125rem` | The base of every rounded corner |\n| `--font-sans` | System fonts | Body type |\n| `--font-heading` | `Newsreader Variable` | Headings |\n\n## A new set of colours\n\nHere is a florist's shop with a deep rose for the main colour and a warm white page:\n\n```css\n:root {\n  --background: #fbf8f4;\n  --foreground: #3a2a2c;\n  --primary: #8c3b4a;\n  --primary-foreground: #fbf8f4;\n  --muted-foreground: #8f7f80;\n  --border: #eadfd9;\n  --radius: 1rem;\n}\n```\n\nColours can be hex or `oklch()`. We suggest the latter: the hue stays put when you change the lightness.\n\n```css\n:root {\n  --primary: oklch(0.45 0.12 10);\n  --ring: oklch(0.7 0.08 10);\n}\n```\n\n## Only some pages\n\nThe `<body>` of every page carries a `data-page` attribute, so you can change product pages alone:\n\n```css\nbody[data-page=\"product\"] {\n  --radius: 0;\n}\n\nbody[data-page=\"product\"] .price {\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n}\n```\n\n## Another typeface\n\nUpload the font files under \"Files\" first, then refer to them with `@font-face`:\n\n```css\n@font-face {\n  font-family: \"Shop Serif\";\n  src: url(\"/files/shop-serif.woff2\") format(\"woff2\");\n  font-display: swap;\n}\n\n:root {\n  --font-sans: \"Shop Serif\", \"Noto Serif\", serif;\n}\n```\n\nMind `font-display: swap`: without it, text stays invisible until the font has loaded.\n\n## Preview and roll back\n\nBefore saving, press \"Preview\" to see it in a new tab. Every save keeps a version, up to 20, and \"History\" takes you back to any of them in one click.\n\nIf something breaks, the quickest fix is to add `?theme=default` to the address, open the shop with the default theme, and change it back in the admin.\n\n```html\n<!-- Custom CSS goes in after the theme's stylesheet -->\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/assets/theme.css\">\n<style id=\"custom-css\">/* what you wrote */</style>\n```\n\nIf you get stuck, find us at the bottom right of the admin.\n",
  "theme-css.zh-CN": "很多店主问我们：能不能把店铺的颜色改成自己的品牌色？可以，而且不用碰模板。店铺主题里所有颜色、圆角和字体都来自十几个 CSS 变量，在“设置 → 主题 → 自定义 CSS”里覆盖它们就行。\n\n## 主题读哪些变量\n\n| 变量 | 默认值 | 用在哪里 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `--background` | `#f2f4f5` | 页面底色 |\n| `--foreground` | `#1c2433` | 正文文字 |\n| `--primary` | `#1f3a5f` | 按钮、链接、价格 |\n| `--muted-foreground` | `#5b6876` | 次要文字 |\n| `--border` | `#d3dae0` | 卡片和输入框的边框 |\n| `--radius` | `0.125rem` | 所有圆角的基准 |\n| `--font-sans` | 系统字体 | 正文字体 |\n| `--font-heading` | `Newsreader Variable` | 标题字体 |\n\n## 换一套颜色\n\n下面是一家花店的例子，把主色换成了深玫瑰色，背景换成暖白：\n\n```css\n:root {\n  --background: #fbf8f4;\n  --foreground: #3a2a2c;\n  --primary: #8c3b4a;\n  --primary-foreground: #fbf8f4;\n  --muted-foreground: #8f7f80;\n  --border: #eadfd9;\n  --radius: 1rem;\n}\n```\n\n颜色可以写成十六进制，也可以用 `oklch()`。我们更推荐后者，调亮度时色相不会跑偏：\n\n```css\n:root {\n  --primary: oklch(0.45 0.12 10);\n  --ring: oklch(0.7 0.08 10);\n}\n```\n\n## 只改某一类页面\n\n每个页面的 `<body>` 上都有一个 `data-page` 属性，可以用它只改商品页：\n\n```css\nbody[data-page=\"product\"] {\n  --radius: 0;\n}\n\nbody[data-page=\"product\"] .price {\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n}\n```\n\n## 换字体\n\n自定义字体需要先在“文件”里上传字体文件，然后用 `@font-face` 引用：\n\n```css\n@font-face {\n  font-family: \"Shop Serif\";\n  src: url(\"/files/shop-serif.woff2\") format(\"woff2\");\n  font-display: swap;\n}\n\n:root {\n  --font-sans: \"Shop Serif\", \"Noto Serif SC\", serif;\n}\n```\n\n注意 `font-display: swap`，没有它的话字体加载完之前文字是看不见的。\n\n## 预览和回滚\n\n保存前可以点“预览”，在新标签页里看效果。每次保存都会留下一个版本，最多保留 20 个，在“历史”里可以一键回到任何一个版本。\n\n如果改坏了，最快的办法是在地址后面加上 `?theme=default`，用默认主题打开店铺，再去后台改回来。\n\n```html\n<!-- 自定义 CSS 最终会插在主题样式表之后 -->\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/assets/theme.css\">\n<style id=\"custom-css\">/* 你写的内容 */</style>\n```\n\n有问题可以在后台右下角找到我们。\n"
}
